 !Example JETSPIN input file 25: the evaporative counterpart of Test Case 24.
 !Every directive is identical to examples/input-24/input.dat except
 !"evaporation yes": same canonical electrostatics (density charge 44000,
 !collector distance 16 cm, external potential 30.02076857), same Maxwell
 !rheology, stochastic Platen air drag, insertion and removal from Test
 !Case 23, same single-nozzle-bead start and print directives from
 !Example 3, and the same Example 5 refinement cadence (0.4 cm / 1.d-3 s).
 !
 !The pair exists because evaporation does not currently survive this
 !configuration. Test Case 24 (evaporation off) runs cleanly; this input
 !reaches the code's own numerical instability check at step 1078685 with a
 !stress NaN at bead 30, about 1% into its 1e8-step target, on the ordinary
 !host integrator path. Keeping the two inputs side by side makes the
 !controlled comparison reproducible with a single keyword difference.
 !
 !See docs/examples/test-25.md.

 system 4
 integrator 4

 timestep 5.d-9
 final time 0.5d0
 print time 1.d-2
 seed 317

 print xyz 1.d-4
 print xyz maxnumber 400

 print list t x vn vc yz n angl lp rc
 printstat list t x vn yz n curn curc

 multiple step no
 dynamic refinement yes
 dynamic refinement start 2.5d-4
 dynamic refinement every 1.d-3
 dynamic refinement threshold 0.4d0
 dynamic refinement anchor 0.10d0

 airdrag yes
 airdrag airdensity     0.00121d0
 airdrag airviscosity   0.1511d0
 airdrag amplitude      1.d0
 airdrag airvelocity    -1000.d0

 inserting yes
 removing yes
 gravity yes

 points 1
 initial length 0.02
 nozzle velocity 0.282942121d0
 nozzle stress 0.d0
 yield stress   0.d0
 nozzle cross   0.005d0
 density mass   0.839253525d0
 density charge 44000.d0
 viscosity      20.d0
 elastic modulus 50000.d0
 collector distance 16.d0
 surface tension 21.133d0

 perturbation yes
 perturbation frequency 1.d4
 perturbation amplitude 1.d-3

 !Canonical JETSPIN potential; see the header note.
 external potential 30.02076857d0
 evaporation yes
 evaporation polymer frac 0.06d0
 evaporation airviscosity 0.15d0
 evaporation temperature 293.15d0
 evaporation umidity 0.165d0
 evaporation bconstant 7.d0
 evaporation mconstant 0.1d0
 evaporation tconstant 1.d0
 evaporation diffusivity 0.242d0

 Finish
